{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Snuggly 是一款讓孕婦在家以 iPhone 聆聽、錄製及分享胎兒心跳的應用程式，適合希望記錄孕期時刻及與家人分享喜悅的準父母。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-57.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄孕期心跳時刻</h2>\n<p>Snuggly 讓準父母只靠 iPhone 在家尋找、聆聽及錄下胎兒心跳，並按孕期週數保存錄音，方便與親友分享。應用程式以演算法隔離及放大微弱聲音，使用時宜保持安靜、戴上耳機並慢慢移動手機；官方建議第 22 週起效果較佳，較早週數可每週嘗試。它毋須額外配件，屬孕期連結用途，並非醫療診斷工具。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-79-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-80-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-81-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-82-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-83-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-84-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Snuggly: Record Baby Heartbeat</li><li>應用類別：Medical</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/snuggly-record-baby-heartbeat/id1663946323?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:57.493838+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:08:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:38:58.650853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:18:32.794388+00:00","content_hash":"47b1051df4740f9b04fb900691a9177ae0ed5b49c5714c5e3c2f9e7157ba6a9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}